#
# Overrides for the Semgrep lockfile (see semgrep.in). Every Semgrep release up to 1.184.0 pins mcp==1.29.0 and
# opentelemetry-api>=1.37,<1.38, which carry open Dependabot alerts (mcp fixed in 1.30.0, opentelemetry-api in 1.45.1).
# CI installs the lockfile with --no-deps and uses only `semgrep scan` and `semgrep --test`, never `semgrep mcp`, so
# the lock takes the fixed releases and the whole opentelemetry family moves together to keep it consistent.
# Remove an override once a Semgrep release no longer pins the package below its fixed version.
mcp>=1.30.0,<2
opentelemetry-api>=1.45.1
opentelemetry-sdk>=1.45.1
opentelemetry-proto>=1.45.1
opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-common>=1.45.1
opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http>=1.45.1
